  "description": "Our Tetra frame is now offered with a new 44mm head tube and an oversized down tube. These changes create compatibility with tapered steerer forks, increases frame stiffness for a livelier feel, and provides more efficient power transmission.\n\nEven bicycle enthusiasts and industry insiders are surprised to learn that Tetra was invented back in 1987 and only four years later was being ridden by Greg LeMond and his Team Z teammates in the world’s most important cycling event, the Tour de France. Read more…\n\nAvailable in Pro (road) and Adventure (endurance/gravel/cyclocross)\n\nOptional S and S Machine couplers\n\nOptional PressFit 30 carbon bottom bracket shell (Carbon wrapped bb only – not lugged)\n\nOptional rear axle spacing, tire clearance, brake type, cable routing and threaded eyelets\n\nOptional custom frame geometry\n\nFrame stiffness options\n\n25 Year Warranty\n\nBest combination of stiffness and comfort for everyday riding\n\nTubing is crash tolerant\n\nLighter than Luna\n\nHighest performance coupled travel frame on market",
